      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Closing as \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-848\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-848\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Tidy-up FeSL policy validation\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-848\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n covers the outstanding validation issue.  Also there are tests in ConfigC for the behaviour reported by this issue.</p>",
     "created": "15/Jan/11 8:12 AM",
     "id": "11769",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10771/comment/11769",
